('hr-ref-001','I am a [role or degree] with experience in [relevant skill]. In [project], I solved [specific problem] and achieved [result]. This role interests me because it combines that experience with [team goal].',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-002','My strongest skills are [skill one] and [skill two]. For example, I used them in [project] to produce [measurable result]. I would apply the same approach to this team''s work.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-003','I sometimes spend too long refining a first draft. I now set a review deadline, ship a workable version, and improve it from feedback; that helped me finish [project] on time.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-004','Your team works on [specific product or problem], and I was interested in [specific detail]. My experience with [relevant skill] would let me contribute to [concrete goal].',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-005','In five years, I hope to own larger technical problems and mentor newer teammates. First I want to become excellent at the responsibilities of this role and earn that scope through results.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-006','Hard work is sustained effort; smart work chooses the highest-impact task and tests whether the approach works. In [example], I combined both by prioritizing [task] and tracking [outcome].',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-007','I separate urgent decisions from tasks that can wait, agree on priorities, and communicate risks early. During [situation], that helped me deliver [result] without sacrificing quality.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-008','A group can work in parallel, while a team coordinates around a shared result and holds one another accountable. I try to make goals and ownership explicit so the team can depend on each other.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-009','I have learned a great deal in my current position, especially [skill]. I am looking for more opportunity to work on [specific challenge] and believe this role offers that scope.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-010','I first clarify the decision and the evidence behind it. I share my concern privately, suggest an alternative, and support the agreed direction unless it creates a serious ethical or safety issue.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-011','I am motivated by solving a useful problem and seeing the effect of the solution. Clear feedback and ownership help me stay engaged, as [project result] showed.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-012','In [situation], I made [specific mistake]. I took responsibility, corrected [impact], and changed [process] so the same failure was less likely to recur.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-013','Based on the responsibilities and market range for this role, I am targeting [range]. I am open to discussing the full package and would like to understand the scope and expectations first.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-014','I follow [reliable source or community], then test relevant ideas in a small project. Recently I learned [topic] and applied it to [specific task].',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-015','I bring [relevant skill], evidence from [project], and a habit of learning from feedback. The result was [outcome], which matches the work this team needs done.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-016','I set a clear goal, invite input from people closest to the work, and make decisions visible. In [example], that helped the group deliver [result] while keeping ownership clear.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-017','I listened to the customer''s specific concern, restated the expected outcome, and offered a realistic next step. After [action], we resolved [issue] and kept them informed.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-018','I can [relocate/travel under these conditions]. I would want to understand the frequency, notice period, and support available so I can make a reliable commitment.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-019','I find avoidable harm or repeated disrespect frustrating. I respond by documenting the issue, addressing it calmly, and escalating when needed instead of reacting in the moment.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-020','My near-term goal is to become effective in [role responsibility]. Longer term, I want to own [broader challenge] and help others grow, based on consistent performance.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-021','During that period I was [truthful activity]. I used the time to develop [skill or responsibility], and [project or evidence] shows I am ready to return to this work.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-022','I understand that your organization serves [customer] through [product]. I noticed [recent, verified detail] and would like to help with [relevant challenge].',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-023','I ask for a concrete example, check that I understand the impact, and agree on one change to try. I followed that process after [feedback] and improved [result].',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-024','I work best where goals are clear, colleagues can challenge ideas respectfully, and feedback arrives early. I can adapt my working style as long as expectations and ownership are explicit.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-025','What would success look like in the first three months? I would also like to know which challenge the team most wants this hire to solve.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-026','I start with the official documentation, build a small working example, and ask a teammate to review my assumptions. That approach helped me learn [technology] for [project].',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-027','My greatest setback was [specific event]. I owned my part, repaired [impact], and changed [habit or process]; the experience now shapes how I check risks before delivery.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-028','I ask what changed and which constraints still hold, then revise the plan in small steps. In [example], this let me preserve [important outcome] while adapting to [new requirement].',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-029','Yes. I make my own commitments visible, ask early when a teammate is blocked, and share credit for the outcome. In [project], this helped us deliver [result].',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-030','I identify the most important outcome, break it into milestones, and reserve focused time for the hardest task. I review progress daily and renegotiate dates before they become surprises.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-031','I hope they would say I follow through and communicate clearly. A colleague in [project] mentioned [specific feedback], and I have worked to make that a consistent habit.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-032','I confirm which deadline protects the most important outcome, estimate effort, and show the trade-offs to stakeholders. Then I sequence work and provide updates as risks change.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-033','I would focus on the work, ask for clear expectations, and raise concerns with specific examples. If behavior stayed harmful, I would use appropriate management or HR channels.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-034','I am comfortable with measured experiments. I define the potential benefit, limit the downside, and choose a small test before committing more time or resources.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-035','I enjoy making progress on a problem that matters, especially when the team can see the result. In [example], [impact] made the work particularly satisfying.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-036','The hardest task was [challenge] because [constraint]. I broke it into [steps], asked for help where appropriate, and delivered [evidence of result].',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-037','I define success as a useful outcome delivered responsibly, not just activity. I measure it with [relevant metric] and feedback from the people affected.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-038','No. I would clarify the request and explain the risk of a false statement. I would help find an accurate way to communicate the situation and escalate an unethical instruction.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-039','I can support occasional planned off-hours work when the role requires it. I would want to understand the schedule, rotation, and recovery time so the arrangement remains sustainable.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-040','Outside work I spend time on [real interest]. It helps me [learn, recharge, or connect with others], and I am happy to share a recent example.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-041','Yes, I would still want to solve useful problems. I might have more freedom to choose them, but learning, contributing, and working with others matter to me.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-042','I would check whether expectations and blockers are clear, then have a private conversation. We would agree on support, a measurable next step, and a follow-up date.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-043','I would explain my concern with evidence and listen to the reasons for the decision. Once the team chooses a direction, I commit to it and watch the agreed success measure.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-044','I triage commitments, protect time for critical work, and tell stakeholders what must move. If the load remains unsustainable, I raise it early rather than silently extending hours.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-045','My attendance has been [truthful record]. When I need time away, I give notice, document handoffs, and make sure critical work has coverage.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-046','I regret [real decision] because [impact]. I learned [specific lesson] and now use [new behavior] when a similar decision comes up.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-047','I would rate myself [honest score] because I have evidence in [example] and room to improve in [area]. I focus more on whether the team can succeed than on the number.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-048','I know [competitor] approaches [market need] through [verified distinction]. What interests me about this company is [specific advantage or direction] and how this role can support it.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-049','If I have not managed a termination, I would say so. If I have, I would describe how I documented expectations, gave fair feedback, involved HR, and treated the person respectfully.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-050','Age is not relevant to whether someone sets clear goals and makes sound decisions. I am comfortable reporting to a manager with the right responsibilities and learning from their experience.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-051','Each move had a clear reason: [brief truthful reasons]. The common thread is [skill or goal], and I am looking for a role where I can apply it over the longer term.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-052','My strongest achievement was [project]. I was responsible for [contribution], and the outcome was [measurable result] for [users or team].',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-053','The three things I value most are meaningful responsibility, constructive feedback, and a team that respects quality. Those conditions help me deliver [relevant outcome].',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-054','I ask which part of the experience fell short and avoid arguing with the client. I agree on a correction and follow up with the result, while sharing what the team can improve.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-055','I began with [role or education], where I learned [foundation]. I moved into [next stage] to take on [challenge], and [recent result] led me to apply for this role.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-056','The combination of [specific responsibility] and [company goal] stood out. I have practiced [skill] in [example], so the role feels like a strong next step.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-057','I would tell the affected people promptly, assess the impact, and correct what I can. Afterward I would document the cause and add a check that prevents a repeat.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-058','I need clear priorities, candid feedback, and room to ask questions early. With those in place, I can own decisions and keep my manager informed of risks.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-059','I noticed [recurring delay or error] in [process]. I mapped the steps, tested [small change], and measured [result] before asking the team to adopt it.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-060','I connect repetitive work to its purpose and look for safe ways to improve the process. I also set small milestones so quality stays consistent rather than relying on novelty.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-061','I met each person separately to understand the facts, then brought them together around a shared goal. We agreed on ownership and follow-up, which reduced [specific friction].',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-062','I would clarify the request and explain why it violates a policy or principle. I would not perform the task, and I would use the organization''s reporting route if needed.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-063','I would first confirm whether it was an oversight. I would share the relevant work history privately, ask for a correction, and involve a manager if the pattern continued.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-064','The least engaging role was [truthful example], but it taught me [useful skill]. I stayed accountable by setting clear output goals and looking for process improvements.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-065','I would prefer that you contact my current employer after we reach a later stage and agree on timing. I can provide other references now who can speak directly about my work.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-066','I usually work [truthful range] hours and organize them around outcomes. When deadlines require extra effort, I communicate the plan and make sure it is sustainable.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-067','I would first learn how the team works and identify its current priorities. After that, I might propose [small evidence-based improvement], test it, and adjust based on feedback.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-068','I respect a manager''s role and judgment regardless of age. What matters is clear communication, fair decisions, and our ability to help the team succeed.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-069','Compensation reflects many factors, including role scope and timing. I have focused on building [skill or impact], and I am now looking for a package that fits the responsibilities of this position.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-070','They might describe me as [two real traits] because I [specific behavior]. I would support that with [feedback or example] rather than claim a trait without evidence.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-071','I can help with occasional weekend work for a release or incident when expectations are clear. I would ask about rotation, notice, and time off afterward.',null,null,null),
('hr-ref-072','I worry most about [credible professional risk], so I take action rather than hide it. For example, I use [review or communication habit] to reduce that risk.',null,null,null),
